  image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 14b04f2709bfc6348abb97a34106bee8, type: 3}
  title: Cat or Dog Person?
  description: "In test chamber #67 there are two pedestals. One holds a fluffy kitten.
    The other a fluffy puppy. Which should your clone pet?\r"
  A_ButtonText: Kitten
  A_Chance: 50
  A_SuccessModifier:
    skillType: 8
    needType: 8
    checkValue: 0
    checkIfLower: 0
    modifyValue: 0
  A_SuccessDescription: "The kitten purrs and paws at the clone lovingly, bringing
    happiness to its lab-made heart. [Max social]\r"
  A_SuccessEffects:
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7712e7205a2d0f74380f90e465520254, type: 2}
  A_FailureDescription: "The kitten accepts your clones pets contentedly\u2026for
    a moment. But it quickly changes its mind and makes a swipe attack. The clone
    is left with many slashes. [No effect]\r"
  A_FailureEffects: []
  B_ButtonText: Puppy
  B_Chance: 50
  B_SuccessModifier:
    skillType: 8
    needType: 8
    checkValue: 0
    checkIfLower: 0
    modifyValue: 0
  B_SuccessDescription: "The puppy and clone are fast friends and many pets and cuddles
    are given. [Max social]\r"
  B_SuccessEffects:
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7712e7205a2d0f74380f90e465520254, type: 2}
  B_FailureDescription: "Turns out this clone is allergic to puppies. Within a few
    minutes the clone is a sputtering mess. It is covered in puppy hair and struggling
    to breathe once the test comes to a close. [Reduced hygeine]\r"
  B_FailureEffects:
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: c612849ed2c305b4b8ef30d3d790212a, type: 2}
